      "export": true,
      "active_variant": true,
      "notes": "Printed 1 mm body shell retaining the Microduck outline, existing mounts and closed rear top return. Relieved round the Zeee 2S holder with a 0.4 mm nominal gap (0.367 mm measured minimum); the upper rear relief follows the holder's closed side shoulders and the lower rear tip has a 1.5 mm round. Two integrated shell ties meet at the centre plane, with the upper tie moved 7.3 mm rearward and 0.3 mm upward into the closed top rim; the remaining shell edge stops 0.3 mm short. Left receivers have blind 1.6 mm forming pilots for 6 mm nominal engagement of M2 x 8 mm screws, with 1.5 mm tip space. Internal tube roots have 1.5 mm front and 0.8 mm upper fillets. See docs/body-shells.md and docs/lipo-battery.md. Physical screw fit and strength unverified."
